<title>USA: AVX names COO Gilbertson as president.</title>
<headline>AVX names COO Gilbertson as president.</headline>
<text>
<p>MYRTLE BEACH, S.C., July 17 - AVX Corp said Thursday its board had elected Chief Operating Officer John Gilbertson as president.</p>
<p>Gilbertson, who will remain COO, succeeds Chief Executive Benedict Rosen, who became chairman on July 8.</p>
